   <title><![CDATA[Toward a Protestant Feudalism [Having Two Legs]]]></title>
   <link/>
   <description><![CDATA[<p>We&rsquo;re living in a fractured, spinning world where everyone scrambles for something to center them, latching onto the state, racial identity, or cultural trends, but all of these miss the mark. The true anchor isn&rsquo;t in superficial unity or tribal divisions; it&rsquo;s covenant&mdash;a God-given structure that binds us in family, nation, and faith under Christ&rsquo;s lordship, grounding us in a real, earthy loyalty that can handle the weight of human life without veering into chaos.</p>
<p>Read the full blog post here: https://tobyjsumpter.com/toward-a-protestant-feudalism/</p>]]></description>
